OL,3,GNEWSAJustin McNulty still a 'valued
OL,4,Amember', says SDLP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FSDLP leader Claire Hanna has said that
OL,7,FJustin McNulty remains a "valued
OL,8,Fmember" of the party after he failed to
OL,9,Fbe selected as a candidate for Newry
OL,10,Fand Armagh in next year's Northern
OL,11,FIreland Assembly election.
OL,13,FCrossmaglen councillor Pete Byrne won
OL,14,Fthe vote at a selection convention in
OL,15,FNewry last week.
OL,17,FMcNulty has been an assembly member for
OL,18,Fthe SDLP since 2016.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
