OL,3,GNEWSAJustin McNulty still a 'valued
OL,4,Amember', says SDLP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Hanna said selection
OL,7,Fprocesses could be "difficult" but that
OL,8,Fshe sees a role for both men in the
OL,9,Fparty.
